 substance use, which can be influenced by socioeconomic factors. People need access to resources to eat healthy and participate in normal activities like shopping.  Understanding cultural differences and the nuances of communication, even the way a tongue moves, is essential when dealing with these issues in any country.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "Oregon", "logprob": -0.005666265729814768}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.14107558131217957}, {"token": "s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁trial", "logprob": -0.7420072555541992}, {"token": "▁program", "logprob": -1.6401894092559814}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.8520860075950623}, {"token": "▁decriminal", "logprob": -0.0008249455713666975}, {"token": "izing", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁drugs", "logprob": -0.03508646786212921}, {"token": "▁ends", "logprob": -0.1281079649925232}, {"token": "▁Sunday", "logprob": -0.4174525737762451}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.6956461668014526}, {"token": "▁reverting", "logprob": -0.9281154870986938}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.025114908814430237}, {"token": "▁stricter", "logprob": -0.3053274154663086}, {"token": "▁penalties", "logprob": -0.13627409934997559}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.003882015822455287}, {"token": "▁possessing", "logprob": -0.06585869193077087}, {"token": "▁small", "logprob": -9.822363062994555e-05}, {"token": "▁amounts", "logprob": -0.20141509175300598}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -2.3245540432981215e-05}, {"token": "▁hard", "logprob": -0.008644895628094673}, {"token": "▁drugs", "logprob": -0.016780298203229904}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.029184410348534584}, {"token": "▁The", "logprob": -0.10791622847318649}, {"token": "▁new", "logprob": -0.3075896203517914}, {"token": "▁law", "logprob": -0.020564088597893715}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.003689270233735442}, {"token": "▁HB", "logprob": -9.786603914108127e-05}, {"token": "4", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "0", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "0", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"toke